\newlabel{tab:nbaiot_baselines}{{10}{17}{N-BaIoT cross-dataset comparison (Danmini doorbell, 3-seed mean $\pm $ std). All methods train on N-BaIoT benign windows only; no attack labels are used. Isolation Forest uses 72 hand-engineered statistical features; \ours {} fine-tuned uses a general-purpose Moirai backbone with Gaussian-noise negatives}{table.caption.11}{}}
